---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Muhammad Atif"
  description="About Muhammad Atif — Senior Software Engineer specializing in enterprise software, Microsoft 365, SharePoint, Power Platform, cloud, and AI."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">
        About Me
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">
        Senior Software Engineer building enterprise solutions
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-600">
        I am a senior software engineer with 18+ years of experience designing
        and delivering enterprise applications, Microsoft platforms,
        automation solutions, and AI-powered systems.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
          Enterprise Engineering
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
          Extensive experience building enterprise applications using C#,
          .NET, ASP.NET Core, REST APIs, SQL Server, and distributed
          application architectures.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
          Microsoft Platforms
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
          Deep experience across SharePoint, Microsoft 365, SharePoint
          Framework, Power Apps, Power Automate, Power Platform, and enterprise
          migration and modernization.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
          AI Engineering
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
          Exploring practical enterprise AI through LLM applications,
          retrieval-augmented generation, vector search, prompt engineering,
          and intelligent automation.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">
          Engineering Philosophy
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
          Solve the problem, not just the technology
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-7 text-slate-600">
          <p>
            I approach software development from both an engineering and
            business perspective. A successful solution should be technically
            sound, maintainable, secure, and aligned with the organization's
            actual needs.
          </p>

          <p>
            My experience across software development, SharePoint,
            Microsoft 365, cloud platforms, and automation has given me a
            broad perspective on enterprise technology and modernization.
          </p>

          <p>
            More recently, I have been applying the same engineering principles
            to AI systems — focusing on architecture, retrieval quality,
            grounding, evaluation, security, and practical business value.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">
          Core Technologies
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="skill-tag">C#</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">.NET</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET Core</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SQL Server</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint Online</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">SPFx</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">React</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Power Apps</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Power Automate</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Microsoft 365</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Azure</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">PowerShell</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">LLMs</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">RAG</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Vector Search</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">AI Automation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">18+</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Years of engineering experience
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">7TB+</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Enterprise content migration experience
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">GCC</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
            Enterprise delivery experience
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>